Derived code
------------
Parts of the following files derive from the R package amen (version 1.4.5),
Copyright (c) Peter Hoff, Bailey Fosdick, Alex Volfovsky and Yanjun He, licensed
under the GNU General Public License, version 3:

  R/mgc-stats.R     from amen::rbeta_ab_fc()
  R/mgc-prior.R     from the prior block of amen::ame() and amen::rbeta_ab_fc()
  R/mgc-sampler.R   from the starting values and scan order of amen::ame()

These parts were modified in 2026 for the hierarchical multi-group Selection
model: the coefficient step is replaced and the additive-effect step is split
from it. The sampler also calls functions exported by amen at run time, among
them design_array(), precomputeX(), mhalf(), Xbeta(), zscores(), rZ_nrm_fc(),
rZ_bin_fc(), rs2_fc(), rrho_mh() and rSuv_fc().

